      "body": "项目地址：https://github.com/JuneYaooo/social-account-doctor\n\n我前段时间做了个支持各种自媒体平台找对标，拆爆款的skills，效果真的很好，顺手分享一下，如果有用欢迎给我点个星星，谢谢~\n\n<img width=\"891\" height=\"849\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/144d18e0-54a4-4bb6-882c-e80236e169ae\" />\n\n能帮你找到对标的账号，分析他们的笔记，直接给你看内容，做对比，出一份详细的PDF报告。\n\n<img width=\"819\" height=\"746\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7157dcd0-6b10-422d-add6-215d42871163\" />\n\n<img width=\"770\" height=\"826\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1401f1d1-e985-4792-9ed4-7b7eb139fdd1\" />",
